          "text": "Témoignages: DUPPIGHEIM (67) --.--.2000",
          "text_sha256": "6f0360dc1c9e49aba7269c9df3bf1d47f07d996586ad445db19d870ac5cc1a69"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
